{"id":"340d363b06fe8470","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega.md","title":"原书的ω加ω闭包程序","display":"ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega — 原书的ω加ω闭包程序","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega","aliases":["72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega"],"display":"ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega — 原书的ω加ω闭包程序","depends_on":["[[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]]","[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Example3.3.2, print653/PDF665; all three clauses and definition forms checked on page image","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega — 原书的ω加ω闭包程序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"585b074277aea3ae\" href=\"?note=585b074277aea3ae\" title=\"72-df-program-transfinite-stages\">72-df-program-transfinite-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64b08328ac145622\" href=\"?note=64b08328ac145622\" title=\"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization\">72-thm-program-closure-stabilization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Example3.3.2, print653/PDF665; all three clauses and definition forms checked on page image"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定互异非逻辑符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,f,R,S\">\\(0,f,R,S\\)</span>，变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v_0,v=v_1\">\\(u=v_0,v=v_1\\)</span>。项编码及程序、四值结构、信息序使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"585b074277aea3ae\" href=\"?note=585b074277aea3ae\" title=\"72-df-program-transfinite-stages\">72-df-program-transfinite-stages</a> 的本册接口。签名、Herbrand域、函数解释和程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 在下式构造。</li>\n<li>一元关系记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^M(t),S^M(t)\">\\(R^M(t),S^M(t)\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^M(\\langle t\\rangle),S^M(\\langle t\\rangle)\">\\(R^M(\\langle t\\rangle),S^M(\\langle t\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_{P,\\omega\\cdot2}\">\\(\\mathcal J_{P,\\omega\\cdot2}\\)</span> 按这些固定数据实例化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\alpha\">\\(M_\\alpha\\)</span> 是其第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le\\omega\\cdot2\">\\(\\alpha\\le\\omega\\cdot2\\)</span> 阶段。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\omega\">\\(k,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf f=(0,1)\">\\(\\mathsf f=(0,1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf u=(0,0)\">\\(\\mathsf u=(0,0)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_P\">\\(c_P\\)</span> 为同一基底的闭包序数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{f\\},\\{\\langle f,1\\rangle\\},\\{R,S\\},\\{\\langle R,1\\rangle,\\langle S,1\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nt_0&amp;:=0,\\qquad t_{n+1}:=f(t_n),\\qquad D:=\\{t_n:n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nI_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,t_0\\rangle\\},\\qquad I_F:=\\{\\langle f,\\{\\langle\\langle t_n\\rangle,t_{n+1}\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nP&amp;:=\\{\\langle R(f(u)),\\langle R(u)\\rangle\\rangle,\\ \\langle S(f(u)),\\langle S(u)\\rangle\\rangle,\\ \\langle S(u),\\langle R(v)\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\\\\nM_\\alpha&amp;:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\omega\\cdot2}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{f\\},\\{\\langle f,1\\rangle\\},\\{R,S\\},\\{\\langle R,1\\rangle,\\langle S,1\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nt_0&amp;:=0,\\qquad t_{n+1}:=f(t_n),\\qquad D:=\\{t_n:n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nI_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,t_0\\rangle\\},\\qquad I_F:=\\{\\langle f,\\{\\langle\\langle t_n\\rangle,t_{n+1}\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nP&amp;:=\\{\\langle R(f(u)),\\langle R(u)\\rangle\\rangle,\\ \\langle S(f(u)),\\langle S(u)\\rangle\\rangle,\\ \\langle S(u),\\langle R(v)\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\\\\nM_\\alpha&amp;:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\omega\\cdot2}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR^{M_k}(t_n)&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&amp;n&lt;k,\\\\\\mathsf u,&amp;k\\le n,\\end{cases}\n&amp; S^{M_k}(t_n)&amp;=\\mathsf u,\\\\\nR^{M_{\\omega+k}}(t_n)&amp;=\\mathsf f,\n&amp; S^{M_{\\omega+k}}(t_n)&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&amp;n&lt;k,\\\\\\mathsf u,&amp;k\\le n,\\end{cases}\\\\\nR^{M_{\\omega\\cdot2}}(t_n)&amp;=S^{M_{\\omega\\cdot2}}(t_n)=\\mathsf f,\n&amp;c_P&amp;=\\omega\\cdot2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR^{M_k}(t_n)&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&amp;n&lt;k,\\\\\\mathsf u,&amp;k\\le n,\\end{cases}\n&amp; S^{M_k}(t_n)&amp;=\\mathsf u,\\\\\nR^{M_{\\omega+k}}(t_n)&amp;=\\mathsf f,\n&amp; S^{M_{\\omega+k}}(t_n)&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&amp;n&lt;k,\\\\\\mathsf u,&amp;k\\le n,\\end{cases}\\\\\nR^{M_{\\omega\\cdot2}}(t_n)&amp;=S^{M_{\\omega\\cdot2}}(t_n)=\\mathsf f,\n&amp;c_P&amp;=\\omega\\cdot2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书三个子句依次为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(f(u))\\!:\\!-R(u)\">\\(R(f(u))\\!:\\!-R(u)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(f(u))\\!:\\!-S(u)\">\\(S(f(u))\\!:\\!-S(u)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(u)\\!:\\!-R(v)\">\\(S(u)\\!:\\!-R(v)\\)</span>；第三条的体变量与头变量不同，不能误写成事实。定义形分别等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(u=f(x)\\land R(x))\">\\(\\exists x(u=f(x)\\land R(x))\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(u=f(x)\\land S(x))\\lor\\exists xR(x)\">\\(\\exists x(u=f(x)\\land S(x))\\lor\\exists xR(x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每个有限阶段只排除有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(t_n)\">\\(R(t_n)\\)</span>；所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists xR(x)\">\\(\\exists xR(x)\\)</span> 仍未知，所有S值未知。到ω时全部R为假，该存在式才为假；随后每一步依次排除一个S值，到ω加ω全部为假并稳定。显示公式按有限归纳、两个极限的坐标上确界及后继envelope逐项验证；每个较早阶段都有一个原子在下一步改变，故界是精确的。这个程序是正的，但三值的否证信息包含无限全称条件；不能将此闭包序数等同于二值Horn立即后果算子的ω阶段界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-program-transfinite-stages","status":"resolved","id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization","status":"resolved","id":"64b08328ac145622","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-transfinite-stages","status":"resolved","id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定互异非逻辑符号 $0,f,R,S$，变量 $u=v_0,v=v_1$。项编码及程序、四值结构、信息序使用 [[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]] 的本册接口。签名、Herbrand域、函数解释和程序 $P$ 在下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"0,f,R,S","display":false},{"tex":"u=v_0,v=v_1","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R^M(t),S^M(t)","display":false},{"tex":"R^M(\\langle t\\rangle),S^M(\\langle t\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_{P,\\omega\\cdot2}","display":false},{"tex":"M_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le\\omega\\cdot2","display":false},{"tex":"k,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf f=(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf u=(0,0)","display":false},{"tex":"c_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma&:=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{f\\},\\{\\langle f,1\\rangle\\},\\{R,S\\},\\{\\langle R,1\\rangle,\\langle S,1\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nt_0&:=0,\\qquad t_{n+1}:=f(t_n),\\qquad D:=\\{t_n:n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nI_C&:=\\{\\langle0,t_0\\rangle\\},\\qquad I_F:=\\{\\langle f,\\{\\langle\\langle t_n\\rangle,t_{n+1}\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nP&:=\\{\\langle R(f(u)),\\langle R(u)\\rangle\\rangle,\\ \\langle S(f(u)),\\langle S(u)\\rangle\\rangle,\\ \\langle S(u),\\langle R(v)\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\\\\nM_\\alpha&:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\omega\\cdot2}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR^{M_k}(t_n)&=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&n<k,\\\\\\mathsf u,&k\\le n,\\end{cases}\n& S^{M_k}(t_n)&=\\mathsf u,\\\\\nR^{M_{\\omega+k}}(t_n)&=\\mathsf f,\n& S^{M_{\\omega+k}}(t_n)&=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&n<k,\\\\\\mathsf u,&k\\le n,\\end{cases}\\\\\nR^{M_{\\omega\\cdot2}}(t_n)&=S^{M_{\\omega\\cdot2}}(t_n)=\\mathsf f,\n&c_P&=\\omega\\cdot2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R(f(u))\\!:\\!-R(u)","display":false},{"tex":"S(f(u))\\!:\\!-S(u)","display":false},{"tex":"S(u)\\!:\\!-R(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x(u=f(x)\\land R(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x(u=f(x)\\land S(x))\\lor\\exists xR(x)","display":false},{"tex":"R(t_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists xR(x)","display":false}],"bytes":3150,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega|ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega — 原书的ω加ω闭包程序]]"},{"id":"aeeeb6862efb50c6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：原来的超限迭代证明现由独立阶段定义、Hartogs稳定论证和lower闭合归纳补齐。显示等式把交集定义与实际迭代值对应起来。原书ω加ω例及其逐阶段计算见 [[72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega]]；不能无条件以ω阶段替代该构造。"}],"outgoing":["585b074277aea3ae","64b08328ac145622"]}